{"id":36394450393,"name":"Delegation Regression (nightly) lane=stability-test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOR6jjtc8AAAAIeUc92Q","head_branch":"dev","head_sha":"7352e78592985400851cf4793466130b7e5e0106","path":".github/workflows/delegation-regression-nightly.yml","display_title":"Delegation Regression (nightly) lane=stability-test","run_number":107,"event":"schedule","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":301124410,"check_suite_id":98541665748,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOR6jjtc8AAAAW8Yp91A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393","pull_requests":[],"created_at":"2026-09-28T07:56:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T08:06:23Z","actor":{"login":"github-merge-queue[bot]","id":118344674,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOBw3L4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-merge-queue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"run_attempt":1,"referenced_workflows":[],"run_started_at":"2026-09-28T07:56:44Z","triggering_actor":{"login":"github-merge-queue[bot]","id":118344674,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOBw3L4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-merge-queue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/check-suites/98541665748","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/runs/36394450393/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/actions/workflows/301124410","head_commit":{"id":"7352e78592985400851cf4793466130b7e5e0106","tree_id":"1bb3a13196acf7ab45f80518a257039f72d2c0e1","message":"feat(OMN-19432): typed-decision effect node routes one decision to TypeSafe Jev, key by secret_ref from the credential store (#3022)\n\n* feat(OMN-19432): typed-decision effect node routes one decision to TypeSafe Jev, key by secret_ref from the credential store\n\nAdds cloud-typesafe-jev to bifrost_delegation.yaml as a typed_decision\nbackend (endpoint https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone, model jev-latest,\nsecret_ref llm.typesafe.api_key). It is not a ladder rung: no routing rule\nor tier references it. node_typed_decision_effect pins it by backend_id,\nresolves endpoint, model, timeout and secret_ref through\nresolve_delegation_backend, and the key through the canonical secret-store\nresolver, which answers an llm.<provider>.<name> ref only from the local\ndelegation credential store, never the environment. The handler maps one\ntyped question (choice, noul, score) to the System One body and the answer\nback, refuses non-public work units before any call, and hands the decision\nto the incumbent on refusal, backend error or low probability.\n\nOnex-Lane: jev-credstore-wire-83\nOnex-Session: 784c87c11d3f475abbfa857756db094c\n\n* fix(OMN-19432): node_typed_decision_effect declares its real HTTP transport\n\nThe contract's metadata.transport_type was left at the scaffold default\nkafka, but the node has no event_bus and calls the TypeSafe Jev backend\nover httpx. That mismatch is a real, new compliance-sweep violation\n(UNDECLARED_TRANSPORT on the httpx import, not baselined at this PR's\nmerge-base with dev): the compliance sweep only recognizes a handler's\ntransport import when the sibling contract.yaml declares the matching\ntransport_type. Declaring http (mapped from the httpx import in\n_TRANSPORT_IMPORT_TO_TYPE) matches the node's actual behavior and clears\nthe sole new_violations entry; local sweep now reports status=compliant,\n0 new violations, reproducing the CI Compliance Sweep gate exactly.\n\nVerified locally: node_compliance_sweep --target-dirs . goes from\nnew_violations=[UNDECLARED_TRANSPORT httpx] to new_violations=[];\ntests/unit/nodes/node_typed_decision_effect, the bifrost overlay loader\ntest, contract_classification tests and test_market_node_runtime_dogfood\nall pass (36 tests); ruff format/check and mypy --strict clean on the\ntouched node.\n\nOnex-Lane: jev-credstore-wire-83\nOnex-Session: 784c87c11d3f475abbfa857756db094c\n\n* fix(OMN-19432): declare api.typesafe.ai in the provider quota policy\n\ntest_every_metered_backend_host_is_declared_in_the_quota_policy\n(OMN-16932) fails closed on any metered backend host the committed\nbifrost_delegation.yaml quota policy does not describe. cloud-typesafe-jev\nadded api.typesafe.ai as a new metered backend without a corresponding\nprovider_quota_policy entry, so the ratchet test caught it (Tests\nSplit 13/20 red, followed by CI Summary and the product-readiness\nshadow job).\n\nNo 429 has been live-observed from this vendor yet, so there is no\nper-code disposition to declare; the host is registered with an empty\ncodes list (matching the openrouter pattern), which keeps behavior at\ndefault_disposition: retryable and gives a future live-observed code a\nplace to land.\n\nOnex-Lane: jev-credstore-wire-83\nOnex-Session: 784c87c11d3f475abbfa857756db094c","timestamp":"2026-09-28T06:05:33Z","author":{"name":"Jonah Gray","email":"jonah@omninode.ai"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1202250677,"node_id":"R_kgDOR6jjtQ","name":"omnimarket","full_name":"OmniNode-ai/omnimarket","private":false,"owner":{"login":"OmniNode-ai","id":209038818,"node_id":"O_kgDODHWt4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209038818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OmniNode-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OmniNode-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OmniNode-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/